# Site progress sync

When you change locale packs, playbooks, field notes, or the site generator:

1. Run `python3 scripts/generate_site_data.py`
2. Run `python3 scripts/validate.py`
3. Include updated `docs/data/progress.json` in the same change set

Do **not** hardcode coverage counts in `docs/index.html`. The page loads live data from `docs/data/progress.json` via `docs/app.js`.

CI also auto-commits a refresh on `main` via `.github/workflows/sync-site-data.yml`, but agents must still regenerate locally so PRs are not stale.
